[I] Safe and secure software updates for embedded Linux

[T] RAUC (Robust Auto-Update Controller) controls the update process on
[T] embedded Linux systems. It is both a target application that runs as an
[T] update client and a host/target tool to create, inspect and modify
[T] signed update bundles, supporting A/B redundant slot setups.

[U] https://rauc.io/

[A] Rauc Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

